# TangTu's connection to YOUR Supabase project (docs/SPEC.md §0.4). Copy this file to `.env` and fill both.
# Project Settings → API keys. Use the PUBLISHABLE key (sb_publishable_…), never the secret key (sb_secret_…).
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_your_key
